{"3098050":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Backseat","steam_appid":3098050,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4947240],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your wife has been kidnapped. To get her back, you must obey BK26: pick up dangerous strangers at night, learn what they know, and avoid giving them a reason to kill you.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drive the wrong people through the night<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Killers, thieves, fraudsters and unstable strangers<\/strong> sit behind you. Listen closely, watch their behavior, and uncover what they are hiding before the ride turns deadly.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3098050\/extras\/5658f85fb84a3a64c8ce64935b9dba11.poster.avif?t=1793095822\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3098050\/extras\/5658f85fb84a3a64c8ce64935b9dba11.webm?t=1793095822\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3098050\/extras\/5658f85fb84a3a64c8ce64935b9dba11.mp4?t=1793095822\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Question without provoking them<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your logbook to profile each passenger. Ask carefully, choose your words, and gather clues without pushing a dangerous person too far.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hack for the answer that keeps you alive<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your computer to search databases, dig through the deep web, and find critical information—maybe even how to defuse the bomb under your car.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3098050\/extras\/44afa1384c7a344d6c882b51d1168134.poster.avif?t=1793095822\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3098050\/extras\/44afa1384c7a344d6c882b51d1168134.webm?t=1793095822\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3098050\/extras\/44afa1384c7a344d6c882b51d1168134.mp4?t=1793095822\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive each ride<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete BK26's missions:<\/strong> Deliver passengers, send your notes, and follow the trail toward your wife.<br><strong>Wrong move, fatal ride:<\/strong> Inside the taxi or outside it, one mistake can end the night.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3098050\/extras\/8b2754054891892d46112a6e50131db2.poster.avif?t=1793095822\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3098050\/extras\/8b2754054891892d46112a6e50131db2.webm?t=1793095822\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3098050\/extras\/8b2754054891892d46112a6e50131db2.mp4?t=1793095822\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decide your fate<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obey BK26, look for another way out, and decide how much you are willing to risk. You are not driving for money. You are driving for your family.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your wife has been kidnapped. To get her back, you must obey BK26: pick up dangerous strangers at night, learn what they know, and avoid giving them a reason to kill you.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drive the wrong people through the night<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Killers, thieves, fraudsters and unstable strangers<\/strong> sit behind you. Listen closely, watch their behavior, and uncover what they are hiding before the ride turns deadly.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3098050\/extras\/5658f85fb84a3a64c8ce64935b9dba11.poster.avif?t=1793095822\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3098050\/extras\/5658f85fb84a3a64c8ce64935b9dba11.webm?t=1793095822\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3098050\/extras\/5658f85fb84a3a64c8ce64935b9dba11.mp4?t=1793095822\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Question without provoking them<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your logbook to profile each passenger. Ask carefully, choose your words, and gather clues without pushing a dangerous person too far.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hack for the answer that keeps you alive<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your computer to search databases, dig through the deep web, and find critical information—maybe even how to defuse the bomb under your car.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3098050\/extras\/44afa1384c7a344d6c882b51d1168134.poster.avif?t=1793095822\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3098050\/extras\/44afa1384c7a344d6c882b51d1168134.webm?t=1793095822\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3098050\/extras\/44afa1384c7a344d6c882b51d1168134.mp4?t=1793095822\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive each ride<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete BK26's missions:<\/strong> Deliver passengers, send your notes, and follow the trail toward your wife.<br><strong>Wrong move, fatal ride:<\/strong> Inside the taxi or outside it, one mistake can end the night.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3098050\/extras\/8b2754054891892d46112a6e50131db2.poster.avif?t=1793095822\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3098050\/extras\/8b2754054891892d46112a6e50131db2.webm?t=1793095822\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3098050\/extras\/8b2754054891892d46112a6e50131db2.mp4?t=1793095822\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decide your fate<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obey BK26, look for another way out, and decide how much you are willing to risk. You are not driving for money. You are driving for your family.<\/p>","short_description":"A psychological taxi horror game where every passenger may be dangerous. Drive through the night, question criminals, read their behavior, hack for clues, and survive each ride to save your kidnapped wife.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian, Hindi<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3098050\/c1f1c924f49c9528daec5035bb2b90ac3fa76d9f\/header.jpg?t=1793095822","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/st